  unitName: Florence Nightingale
  unitId: 850918
  unitNumber: 8633
  description: A nurse from another world who established a foundation to train other
    nurses. Interested in volunteering to aid others since she was very young, she
    helped elevate the position of nurses who had long been considered little more
    than servants through her efforts. She was in charge of all the nursing personnel
    in the hospital she had been sent to help during the war, and she worked hard
    to improve the facility's conditions to decrease the number of patients afflicted
    by infectious diseases. Never hesitating to aid whoever needed her help, her
    work was commended by the Queen herself.
  summonDesc: I wish hospitals were not needed at all. Unfortunately, that would
    only be possible in a world without suffering.
  fusionDesc: I will continue doing everything in my power to help the sick and the
    suffering. That is the only way to end this war!
  evoDesc: I ask for nothing in return but the power to be able to do more, for all.
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
